+// as the CLR's projection does. What the system does not have (notification
+// data binding: NotificationData, ToastNotification.Data, ToastNotifier.Update;
+// ToastNotificationHistory.GetHistory) is kept here: data stays with the toast
+// it was given to, an update finds no toast to update, and the history the
+// program can read is empty.
